{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の、テレ東音楽祭見ていただけましたか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不協和音を生放送で披露させていただきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生放送の不協和音はとても久しぶりでめちゃくちゃ緊張しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、後で放送を見返して、前よりも良くなってる!と思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンス頑張ろう～。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てちの、表情やダンスには毎回感動します。\n僕は嫌だの表情や途中で倒れるところ、終盤にになっても変わらないダンスのキレ･･･。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても尊敬します!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"僕は嫌だ!  と、けやかけの企画でメンバーが言ってみましたがやっぱりてちの僕は嫌だ!は、言葉に出来ない何かが伝わってくる感じがして、収録後は毎回何度も繰り返してそこを見てしまいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんと凄いなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よねごめんね(笑)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN4VR7NX3TM3N1ENMHX3JQ5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nやってやりました～(￣￣￣ｰ￣￣￣)ﾆﾔﾘ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう克服できたかな!へへへ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN4VSDHHF2NWF9R19H71EJG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN4VV3ZDYT812SY0NM8H15K","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN4VX3DM33ZKTTAC8KM7VJ4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN4VYNRG8ZMD4EVVA2R1NAC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ大好き!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて名前か分からないけど･･･"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}